# Maintainer-specific PII patterns — one PCRE per line.
# Copy this file to scripts/.pii-patterns (which is gitignored) and add
# your own values. The scanner reads .pii-patterns at runtime.
#
# Examples:
#
# Real-name tokens (case-insensitive):
#   (?i)\byourlastname\b
#
# Public WAN IP:
#   203\.0\.113\.10
#
# Specific personal email:
#   you@example\.com
